#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Bundle a locally viewable, real-telemetry/schematic investigation replay.

Takes a prepared, provenance-documented five-minute series and daily report
milestones. The full moving assembly is a report-guided *illustration* whose
position is NOT recorded telemetry; the plots are real aggregated rig signals.
"""
